{
  "id": "nx-common-subtree-papers-formalization",
  "title": "NX Common Subtree Papers & Formalization",
  "summary": "A paper- and formalization-focused course on ordered common embedded subtrees (Lozano–Valiente 2004), weighted unordered strict subtree isomorphism (Droschinsky et al. 2016), and weighted topological subtree embedding with distance penalties (Droschinsky et al. 2018). Foundations lead to paper recurrences, theorem correspondence, Lean/Rust refinement and remaining proof obligations.",
